Stryker Mutator Rust

This package is an independent implementation and compatibility experiment. It is
not an official Stryker Mutator release.

The compatibility runner depends on StrykerJS 10.0.0, licensed under Apache-2.0.
Native mutation semantics and the instrumentation runtime are based on StrykerJS:
https://github.com/stryker-mutator/stryker-js
Copyright Stryker Mutator contributors. Original copyright and attribution notices
remain applicable. See LICENSE and the licenses shipped with dependencies.

Oxc is used under its MIT license. napi-rs is used under its MIT license. BLAKE3 is
used under its CC0-1.0 or Apache-2.0 license. See the respective dependency sources
and Cargo.lock for exact versions. Dependencies retain their own licenses.

The conservative native regex mutation rules are derived from weapon-regex 2.0.6,
licensed under Apache-2.0, Copyright Stryker Mutator contributors:
https://github.com/stryker-mutator/weapon-regex/tree/v2.0.6
See src/instrument/regex_mutation.rs for the bounded rule and traversal port.
